/-!
Finite bloom exclusions for two observed boundary literals. These statements
identify no historical header: each application requires equality with the
bloom checked by the supplied original execution. Intermediate blocks and
actual historical header authentication remain separate obligations.
-/

namespace Blanc.Lift.Usdc.HistoricalBloomExclusion

